```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "drop the pending fleet join on this vessel"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.fleet.abandons", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.abandons"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.fleet.abandons"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.abandons ~ the pending join leaves the joining place

`lares fleet join abandon` drops the pending join on the joining place; with none pending it says so. Joins pending for several faces refuse `face-not-named`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ abandon

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`abandon` params=`~ drop the pending join`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ runs in this process on the joining vessel, no vessel standing; its keys mint and stay here`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ face-not-named · face-joinee · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-named` params=`~ joins stand pending for several faces`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-joinee` params=`~ the joinee names no face; the face rides the offer, and --face belongs to offer and answer`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the abandon refused by name (FleetJoinRefused, a store door refusal, or StoreHeld); the line names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ abandoned · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`abandoned` params=`exit/0 ~ the pending join left, or none stood`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

