!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join abandon

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares fleet join abandon]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

